Changes made
------------

otacli was forked from doccli v2.40.0 (commit eeb1aaf) on 2026-08-19.
The modifications made since that point are recorded in CHANGELOG.md and in
this repository's git history. A summary of the initial divergence:

  * Removed the Discord Rich Presence integration, which was tied to the
    doccli project's registered Discord application.
  * Removed the doccli project's AniList API client ID; otacli requires its
    own to be configured.
  * Removed links to the doccli project's Discord server and donation page.
  * Removed the Polish user interface; otacli's interface is English only.
    The streaming sources it reads remain Polish.
  * Replaced the application icons and menu artwork.
  * Renamed the program, its command, and its configuration directory.

